{
  "bodyHash": "fEnz6ThwF/Y=",
  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_4b27a9e4-8414-4d22-bb39-268eebd99129.png\" width=\"1082\" height=\"137\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <iframe width=\"793\" height=\"464\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QW3HqoWXRFg?t=21s\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_8f44d6cd-1169-4d2d-9511-b5ef389b18a4.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">阿爾達的幽匿 Mod 是一款透過改進遊戲中的幽匿方塊，讓你製作更強大工具與物品的模組。</p>\n## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  1.4 及以上版本需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\"><strong>GeckoLib</strong></a>。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">- 模組介紹 -</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_55965104-f602-4470-a603-b3ecb63ccd4a.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_6de15eb4-13de-4a66-b669-df765ce41cae.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">新傳送門</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">遊戲中新增了一個傳送門，你可以利用從遠古城市收集到的新材料製作傳送門點火器，開啟這座遠古傳送門。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  • <strong>遠古世界：</strong>要進入這個維度，需要<strong>遠古世界傳送門點火器</strong>物品。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_4d9c1c2c-050b-479c-8b5c-baa0426a7232.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿花朵</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">新增了多種花朵與植物，可用於裝飾或作為光源。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_9e8b95fa-bb7f-4139-918b-726e60d17cd4.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">遠古城市礦物</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_c5246a13-0b0d-46b1-a25f-08b2877a5b7b.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_34a701e5-29aa-47a2-a43e-fead4b9d5218.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">新戰利品</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">遊戲中新增了更多物品，包括可在遠古城市箱子中找到的幽匿合金升級模板。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e7154663-0921-4958-a706-e42c4dff2ccb.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_bc0c0567-3cdc-4ecb-ab65-228f525df182.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_23463e01-80c6-43fb-8951-85de0964145d.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿魔像</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">在新的 Boss 區域中，你可以與幽匿魔像 Boss 戰鬥，並用它掉落的幽匿結晶製作全新的幽匿合金多功能工具！</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_ff537b25-edec-407c-84ba-5e9a7ca026ce.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fc741a09-dd2d-48cf-96fd-edab0890f7f5.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">暗影獵人</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_44fc05ba-dd0b-410a-a13d-87fcf89a4d33.png\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_f00db0a4-80df-4f05-94d5-db9dcfbc0da5.png\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_93d053d1-63d9-410a-97bb-71701e28ded5.png\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_959ff98e-4c38-4cc1-8e59-364dba172f2b.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">放射性伏守者</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b40fdda4-6413-4979-bc77-18f3cf9a7cd6.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76fd5e0f-bfda-4bf5-a466-3630603d5623.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿手臂</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">新增的幽匿手臂將賦予你如同伏守者般強力的拳頭，這些幽匿手臂可使用遠古城市寶箱及生物身上的材料製作。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b2a99088-58fa-4896-936a-eb1539792919.png\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1fc8c2bd-6f35-4e5f-b726-b38c1e41c56e.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿合金物品！</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">獄髓之後，更強大的幽匿合金工具登場。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_9fd7e796-35b1-42bc-ac15-1b37312ec27a.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2c7d7561-842a-4854-9a5b-2a25e18da36e.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">靈魂幽匿平原</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">地面上的靈魂草相較普通幽匿草，能使生物減速；而周圍的靈魂感測體更可進一步減緩玩家速度。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_ec846fa0-ce1b-47e0-a044-940c96926477.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿平原</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">新維度中的平坦地帶。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e6020889-c83c-4c99-bcde-eef4c0c761c1.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">黑樺森林</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">這是一個危險的生態域，茂密的樹林中潛伏著一隻吱吱作響的生物。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_605904f1-61a8-4013-95c9-413b4960fce9.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿沙漠</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">這是乾旱區域，沒有樹木可生產材料。周圍有遠古傳送門，讓我們有辦法返回主世界。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e3c8c116-1afb-45fe-b727-99c12dad42c1.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">紫藤森林</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">這個生態域被岩石環繞，樹木比其他生態域更加美麗多彩。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b7df097e-32a4-454f-96fe-4c1686b9676d.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿森林</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">幽匿林地是幽匿平原生態域的一種變體，樹木更多、骨頭更少。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_414f0aa3-7617-4e67-952c-ad94e85f4990.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">放射性巴爾沙木森林</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_eda60703-423f-477f-b5dc-00d32d854590.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fa8da897-79e7-499b-bfa8-5ef103658cc1.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿木材系列</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"1205\" height=\"75\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1ac01893-6955-4624-b41f-fb1e1354280a.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">黑樺木材系列</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e8e70767-1c3b-45f4-b2ee-6eceaf3b058a.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">紫藤木材系列</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_a584f0bc-5591-42ea-898b-6099ace7d22b.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">放射性巴爾沙木木材系列</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_50598260-632b-4ae5-b744-689af583bb30.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_efe7618d-1b7b-45b4-90a9-f377145dd764.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿苦力怕</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 幽匿主題的苦力怕，爆炸時會產生黑暗和減速效果。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_4bfd2f4a-7b44-4423-874b-79d316c9b74f.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿骷髏</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 幽匿主題的骷髏，會擊退擊中的生物並賦予黑暗效果。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_bc5c4e19-a4d5-4d56-a7d8-72de778c8d07.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿終界使者</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 幽匿主題的終界使者。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_dba77b96-6ee1-4f4b-a94b-fb73ec921c83.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿魚</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 沒什麼特別的。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_d501e0ce-da66-45fa-a1cf-61a2cba3fb59.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿狐狸</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 幽匿主題的狐狸。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_9e356707-e327-4467-9bbf-da7fbe61cbdb.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">敏捷史萊姆</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 這是一種非常快速且敏捷的史萊姆；死亡時會分裂成兩隻，就像普通史萊姆一樣。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2ee022be-d3a9-4510-9982-d8499e0945c7.png\">\n</p>## <p align=\"center\">幽匿幽靈</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 幽匿幽靈是一種飛行敵對生物，會試圖殺死玩家。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_75909905-e438-492a-bf07-478b8dee2792.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿嘎吱怪</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 一種擁有強力手臂的嘎吱作響的敵對生物。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2614dde6-c021-4fad-98ba-13f9edc2c3a3.png\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_ae6d0147-524f-474b-bfff-e462a8e0cc15.png\"></p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">黑暗村民</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 一位村莊商人，專門販售遠古城市和深淵生態域的特定物品。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_c0a368e9-e92c-4bac-aebe-1a14d7c583e2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_f1a8bcc5-63a3-418d-ac35-5b609c62cdbd.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_cee91609-8965-4784-9005-b7baa64607de.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">進階熔爐</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">將一桶熔岩鐵和一桶熔岩幽匿放入前兩個欄位，然後將要轉化的物品放入第三個欄位，並在第三個欄位下方添加燃料，最後從最後兩個欄位取出普通的兩桶以及轉化後的物品。如上圖範例所示。</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_12e85be5-7ac2-44c6-ab2b-355ae19a3d8a.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_02b588a7-b8bc-4e4c-9239-0561f47fcfa4.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">進階熔爐</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">這就是進階熔爐的樣子！</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_44046397-a602-4049-ac64-1d79431f2108.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_7d390d6c-8416-473f-a09f-8bde137412ba.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">新材料</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">遊戲中新增了進階熔爐，幫助你將獄髓物品提升到更高層次，並在遇到困難時讓事情變得更輕鬆。</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_6bdf82b0-def1-49c4-ab2a-e7d17d1c1d43.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">- 版本 -</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">-1.21.1</p>\n<hr>\n<p align=\"center\">-1.20.1</p>\n<p align=\"center\">-此版本是將 Arda's Sculks 1.4.3.3 從 1.21.1 降級到 1.20.1。</p>\n<p align=\"center\">-建築物中將不會有儲物箱戰利品，且可能存在許多錯誤。</p>\n<p align=\"center\">-這些錯誤將不會被修復，開發重點將放在新版本上。</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">- 已知問題 -</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">（如果我的模組在 Minecraft 伺服器上崩潰，請確保你已安裝 geckolib，因為如果未安裝，模組會直接崩潰而不會發出警告！）<br><br>- 除了一些紋理錯誤外，我沒有發現任何影響遊戲玩法的錯誤。<br><br>- 如果你使用的是 1.20.1 版本，可能會遇到許多錯誤，因為 1.20.1 版本是透過降級 1.21.1 版本新增的，我已經盡力修復了這些錯誤。</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">- 翻譯 -</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fe5a94ce-ebdd-42b1-a135-92ba73b9d529.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"> <strong>Arda Ayd. (Ixra)</strong> :  <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ixraplayer.github.io/\">https://ixraplayer.github.io/</a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_a2dea3a6-e9b8-4156-893d-ab1be0a5e019.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><strong>  Iago Emanuel</strong> :  <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://iagoemanuel.weebly.com/\">https://iagoemanuel.weebly.com/</a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">你可以在模組包中使用我的模組。</p>\n\n[關於模組的更多詳細資訊](https://github.com/IxraPlayer/Ardas-Sculks)",
